{
    "pr_body": "The analytics event emitter delegates the posted events to a bulk processor. When deleting the analytics collection, there's no guarantee that some events are still in flight. This change ensures that these events cannot re-create the underlying index after its deletion. \r\n\r\nCloses #95629\r\nCloses #95657\r\nCloses #95686\r\nCloses #95717",
    "original_commit_id": "e8133edd6c24bb3df16f83fcfe486370bfca791e",
